<title>JAPAN: Mori Denki to announce third-party share allotment.</title>
<headline>Mori Denki to announce third-party share allotment.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mori Denki Manufacturing Co Ltd said it would hold a news conference at 4 p.m. (0700 GMT) on Thursday on a third-party allocation of its shares and a business tie-up.</p>
<p>It will also announce a change in its major shareholders at the same time, the company said.</p>
</text>
